Subject: [PATCH 1/3] PENDING: dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Add LeMans Draco EVK
 compatible strings

Add compatible strings for the Qualcomm LeMans Draco EVK board
based on the SA8775P/QCS9100 SoC.

Signed-off-by: Gopikishan Thawre <gthawre@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index ff8a35df7862..b82cdefe9401 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -470,6 +470,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - qcom,lemans-evk
+              - qcom,lemans-draco-evk
               - qcom,qcs9100-ride
               - qcom,qcs9100-ride-r3
           - const: qcom,qcs9100
